content.text:
```css
button {
  padding: 12px;
}
```

12px is a fixed CSS pixel value.

A rem value relates to the root text size. A percentage relates to the relevant containing context for the property.

```css
.panel {
  width: 80%;
}
p {
  font-size: 1rem;
}
```

